    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-2.4.03-19",
      "block_type": "worked_application",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "The strongest explanation of growing significance therefore combines opportunity and conditions. A suitable solar project can replace some daytime fossil generation; an appropriate hydro resource can contribute low-combustion electricity; biogas can serve a defined fuel need. Their actual contribution is measured in useful delivered energy or displaced fuel under stated conditions. The renewable source remains distinct from the equipment and from the wider supply system that makes it useful.",
